{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"# Papyrus\n🦴 Sans's younger brother; lives with him in a house east of the grocery store, in Hometown."},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Sans**\nHis older brother, with whom he settles in Hometown right before the game begins."},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Gaster (W. D. Gaster)**\nShares with Sans the same total absence on screen, and the same nature as a \"mystery character\" built entirely out of indirect references."},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1","text":"**Where is he?**\nThe most-cited open question about Papyrus."},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1","text":"**Does he confuse Flowey with [[Flowery]]?**\nA speculative idea (not documented in the game, purely a fan hypothesis fitting his Undertale character): since in Undertale Papyrus showed a certain distracted interest in Flowey without giving it much importance,…"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Papyrus_sprite1.webp","x":-190,"y":-405,"width":260,"height":260},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/86374-and-sans-undertale-black-line-white-sprite.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_sans_gaster","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_dondeesta_gaster","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}